# Nothing here is generated, so this list is short on purpose.

# Editor and OS litter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# What the live server accumulates and the theme is not
*.bak
*.broken
_backup-*/

# The dealership's own people. Their photographs live on their server,
# never in the product — CLAUDE.md §5. The empty index.html stays: it is the
# guard against directory listing, and a fresh install needs the folder to
# exist so a dealership can drop tif/os/aj/gianni.{jpg,jpeg,png,webp} into it.
# Same shape as .env.* / !.env.example in the Manager repo.
assets/img/team/*
!assets/img/team/index.html
